{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_trhMEUknAgnIzbqqdQDIw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:01.668550+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_trhMEUknAgnIzbqqdQDIw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>天津大学纳电子科学与芯片工程学院（纳米中心）</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>2027级硕士研究生招生</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span>第二次预推免面试通知</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27lYczNzhIY47Kz0l9kiaWWveCJlGp6dAX65I8jGcic6zq17QOia1aDptSCUCEgwNic7qnyyr9IV2pqicvYf7rjmHsumhurCnt4tYpU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>各位考生：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>天津大学纳电子科学与芯片工程学院（纳米中心）2027级硕士研究生推免招生工作已于2026年5月正式启动。学院聚焦低维电子材料与先进芯片工艺领域，对接国家\"强芯\"战略，主要招收专业包括：电子科学与技术、材料学、仪器科学与技术、化学、物理、电子信息、材料与化工等。</span></p><p><span>现根据学院招生工作安排，定于</span><strong><span>2026年9月19日左右</span></strong><span>举行第二次预推免面试，具体事项通知如下。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24WmspibsgfHQAlfILwxNp2XWicC2S69mMibo8Vge8VreIK9Fq4XsPnZLrT4iaL9apfvWUW7TsjW51xMreVmErbOkEb2H2KP2KZs5Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>◆ </span></strong><span><strong><span>面</span></strong><strong><span>试安排</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><sect