/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26ajniaDSbUxUyxNJ2PIG5Z1bLmKbXsribMLnibT6Rm0leZSUhXbvNXAUBMtOud8Uxkj94uNPhibl2RA49SGmaCzThoZslsoK9SmlU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>◆ </span><span><span>有关说明</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 考生报到时须携带本人身份证、学生证原件及复印件。</span></p><p><span>2. 请准备个人简历（一式五份）及本科成绩单，面试时提交给评委。</span></p><p><span>3. 对于参加本次预推免面试且最终完成录取的考生，学院将在校级学业奖学金（1000—7000元）、院级优秀学生奖学金（500—3000元/人）评优基础上，根据推免生源的本科成绩、学校层次及综合表现等因素，额外授予推免新生雏鹰奖学金（1000—3000元/人），以资鼓励。</span></p><p><span>4. 面试期间考生应遵守考场纪律，服从工作人员安排。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24UgzupXNQUIFjwLe1FXzhWAbiaoeFVgET60RDNtoyof9NKRDV37LAnic71NrzTSbXevCnDxWX5rUTP62PicnRvTT7JLlku2SYfBk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>◆ </span><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生咨询</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>13042201895，朱老师，李老师</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>主任信箱</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>lei.ma@tju.edu.cn（马老师）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></sectio